window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>The past. The present. The future. Their family.</b></p> <p>Grover Hughes is the president of the Dark Horse MC. Ryan Turner is the one who got away. Or rather, the one who ran away.</p> <p>She needs help and protection. He's too stubborn to follow his gut. She's too stubborn to beg.</p> <p>Their past was laced with betrayal. They were never meant to cross paths again.</p> <p>She could be everything he ever wanted. He could be the ruin of her.</p>"; 
